<view class="screen {{dark ? 'dark' : ''}}"><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="avatar">👤</view><view class="title">{{profile.nickname || '时尚达人'}}</view></view><view class="label spaced">编辑资料（本机）</view><input value="{{profile.nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="field" placeholder="昵称" maxlength="40"/><textarea value="{{profile.bio}}" data-field="bio" bindinput="field" placeholder="描述你的风格偏好..." maxlength="200"/></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">📍 所在地区</view><input value="{{profile.location}}" data-field="location" bindinput="field" placeholder="输入城市名称..." maxlength="40"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="save">保存资料</button><view class="notice">天气服务尚未接入</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">📸 个人全身照</view><button class="photo-slot" bindtap="pending">📷 试穿照片功能待接入</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">📋 我的计划（未来安排）</view><view wx:for="{{profile.plans}}" wx:key="id" class="muted">{{item.date}} · {{item.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{!profile.plans.length}}" class="muted">暂无未来计划</view><button class="secondary spaced" bindtap="home">＋ 添加计划</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">风格偏好</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{styles}}" wx:key="label" class="chip {{item.active ? 'active' : ''}}" data-label="{{item.label}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.label}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">体型信息（选填）</view><button class="link" bindtap="pending">身高 · 体重 · 肩宽 · 腰围　待接入</button></view><view class="card row between"><text>深色模式</text><switch checked="{{dark}}" bindchange="theme" color="#C2705A"/></view><view class="notice center">本地联调版本 · 衣橱与历史保存在后端<br/>资料、计划和社区草稿保存在本机</view></view>
